WEBVTT

00:00:06.910 --> 00:00:11.860
I'll become stronger for everyone who supported me.

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:14.800
For my brother who believes in me.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:17.800
I'll win this duel with my improved deck!

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:21.380
And I'll acquire that Ignis.

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:24.210
When I do, I won't get just one.

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:27.520
It'll lead me to the other Ignis.

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:31.480
I’ll see how you’ve improved.

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:37.240
After losing to Spectre, I analyzed my skills and strengthened my deck.

00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:39.220
I know I can win!

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:42.620
By the way, do you have a strategy?

00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:46.960
Her deck uses a variety of combos to shave your LP.

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:50.700
Yeah.  I can’t win unless I stop that.

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:51.470
So?

00:00:51.470 --> 00:00:55.810
I'll set my formation before she starts her combo.

00:00:55.810 --> 00:00:58.610
That means I need to go first!

00:01:01.860 --> 00:01:07.220
How about whoever flies through there first gets to go first?

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:09.950
Fine.

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:35.340
I win!

00:01:38.440 --> 00:01:39.810
I go first!

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:43.960
She gets to go first.

00:02:01.310 --> 00:02:07.320
Our lives aren't forever

00:02:08.120 --> 00:02:14.130
We wander, searching for the meaning of life

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:21.410
Even if it's not the right direction, just keep looking forward

00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:27.980
Sharing hope for the future

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:34.750
tell me  We're searching for memories lost in the darkness

00:02:34.940 --> 00:02:41.990
I feel your flame  Your impulses pierce the light

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:48.670
I want to share your pain

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:20.590
Speed Duel!

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:23.910
My turn!

00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:27.580
I activate the spell card, Trickstar Vision!

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:31.660
I Special Summon a Trickstar from my hand!

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:38.350
When this effect Special Summons a monster, its ATK are halved, and its effects are negated.

00:03:38.350 --> 00:03:41.390
And we both draw one card.

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:43.410
You too.

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:44.730
Yeah.

00:03:47.050 --> 00:03:50.380
Lycoris activates her effect on Lilybell!

00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:52.710
She Special Summons herself!

00:03:53.350 --> 00:03:56.090
Then I return Lilybell to my hand!

00:03:56.640 --> 00:03:59.090
Lilybell’s effect!

00:03:59.090 --> 00:04:05.100
When she's added to my hand other than by a draw, she Special Summons herself!

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:09.070
Shine!  The circuit of courage and determination!

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:14.000
I set Lilybell and Lycoris in the Link Markers!

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:15.770
Link Summon!

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:20.860
Appear, Link 2 Trickstar Divaridis!

00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:24.130
Divaridis’s effect activates!

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:28.250
When she's Special Summoned, you take 200 damage!

00:04:33.130 --> 00:04:34.820
I’m not done!

00:04:34.820 --> 00:04:39.660
From my hand, I activate the Field Spell, Trickstar Live Stage!

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:45.670
When this card activates, you can add a Trickstar in your graveyard to your hand.

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:47.770
Return, Lycoris!

00:04:51.240 --> 00:04:54.480
Live Stage’s additional effect acitvates!

00:04:54.480 --> 00:05:00.720
Once per turn, it Special Summons a Trickstar Token in defense position next to a Trickstar’s link!

00:05:03.890 --> 00:05:08.890
I tribute a Token to Tribute Summon this card!

00:05:08.890 --> 00:05:12.360
Come out, Trickstar Birdhelm!

00:05:12.360 --> 00:05:15.360
Birdhelm’s effect activates!

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:18.010
You take 200 damage!

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:23.480
Then I draw one card.

00:05:25.280 --> 00:05:29.210
But since I used this effect, I can’t battle this turn.

00:05:29.210 --> 00:05:32.440
You can’t battle on the first turn anyway.

00:05:32.440 --> 00:05:35.650
I Special Summon Lycoris from my hand!

00:05:37.720 --> 00:05:40.030
I return Birdhelm to my hand.

00:05:41.890 --> 00:05:45.700
You return your Tribute Summoned monster to your hand?

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:48.250
Birdhelm’s effect activates!

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:54.780
This monster can equip onto a Trickstar Link Monster.

00:05:58.720 --> 00:06:00.510
I end my turn!

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:05.380
My turn!  I draw!

00:06:05.910 --> 00:06:09.640
By adding a card to your hand, Lycoris’s effect!

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:11.900
You take 200 damage!

00:06:16.410 --> 00:06:19.960
It's bad that she was able to go first.

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:24.170
Due to Lycoris, you can't use Burning Draw.

00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:27.450
Your Skill - Burning Draw - is powerful.

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:34.660
By lowering your LP to 100, you can draw one card for every 1000 LP you lost.

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:38.600
But the instant I activate my Skill, I lose.

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:40.220
That’s right.

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:45.860
And Lycoris isn’t the only one that can stop your deck.

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:48.350
Salamangreat Meer’s effect!

00:06:48.350 --> 00:06:53.330
By discarding a Salamangreat, it Special Summon itself!

00:06:54.750 --> 00:06:58.150
Divaridis’s effect activates!

00:06:58.150 --> 00:07:02.620
When you Special Summon a monster, you take 200 damage!

00:07:06.350 --> 00:07:11.150
Each hit isn’t much damage, but it'll add up.

00:07:11.150 --> 00:07:17.080
I must summon a monster that can destroy Divaridis while I still have LP.

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:21.040
I activate Salamangreat Falco’s effect from my graveyard!

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:25.820
By returning a Salamangreat on my field to my hand, it Special Summons itself!

00:07:25.820 --> 00:07:28.760
I return Meer from my field to my hand!

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:30.750
To Special Summon Falco!

00:07:33.280 --> 00:07:34.980
Lycoris’s effect!

00:07:35.380 --> 00:07:37.440
And Divaridis’s effect!

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:39.840
Take a total of 400 damage!

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:44.320
Meer’s effect!

00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:50.080
When it's added to my hand other than by a draw, it Special Summons itself!

00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:53.900
Divaridis’s effect!

00:07:55.900 --> 00:08:00.480
I summon Salamangreat Wolvie!

00:08:02.060 --> 00:08:03.820
Divaridis’s effect!

00:08:03.820 --> 00:08:05.920
You take 200 damage!

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:11.920
He summoned three monsters, knowing he’d take damage.

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:12.940
Here it comes.

00:08:12.940 --> 00:08:14.920
Go, Soulburner!

00:08:14.920 --> 00:08:18.900
Appear!  The circuit that changes the future!

00:08:20.320 --> 00:08:24.740
The summoning conditions are at least two Fire Effect Monsters!

00:08:24.740 --> 00:08:28.200
I set three Salamangreats in the Link Markers!

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:32.020
Link Summon!

00:08:32.020 --> 00:08:37.820
Appear, Link 3 Salamangreat Heatleo!

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:42.380
It's here!

00:08:42.380 --> 00:08:46.160
But Divaridis’s effect deals you damage!

00:08:48.600 --> 00:08:51.160
But due to Heatleo’s effect-

00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:52.500
Too bad.

00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:57.540
I won't let you use Heatleo's effect to return cards from the Spell & Trap Zone.

00:08:57.540 --> 00:08:58.800
What?

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:06.740
Your effects can't target the equip card Birdhelm and the equipped Divaridis.

00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:10.140
So that’s why you equipped it.

00:09:10.140 --> 00:09:12.320
But I'll destroy it!

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:14.240
I set one card.

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:17.820
Battle!  Heatleo attacks Divaridis!

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:25.400
My deck’s weakness is that my monsters have low ATK.

00:09:25.400 --> 00:09:30.880
I kept losing because my opponent broke through before I erased all their LP.

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:32.200
But...

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:39.600
I activate Trickstar Calobane’s effect from my hand!

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:41.790
By sending her to the graveyard...

00:09:41.790 --> 00:09:48.220
...the battling Trickstar gains ATK equal to its original ATK until the end of the turn!

00:09:48.220 --> 00:09:49.180
What?

00:09:49.180 --> 00:09:54.660
Divaridis’s ATK rise from 1800 to 3600!

00:09:54.660 --> 00:09:56.160
She strikes you back!

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:06.240
She increased her ATK.

00:10:09.760 --> 00:10:15.880
When Wolvie is used as Link Material, battle nor effects can destroy my monster this turn!

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:17.880
I end my turn!

00:10:20.380 --> 00:10:25.840
I can see why you’re the charisma duelist and hero who saved Link VRAINS!

00:10:29.780 --> 00:10:31.450
Whining already?

00:10:31.450 --> 00:10:33.760
It's the objective truth that I'm behind.

00:10:33.760 --> 00:10:38.720
But you have one huge edge over Blue Girl.

00:10:39.920 --> 00:10:45.340
You have an excellent AI partner.  Me.

00:10:45.340 --> 00:10:48.180
Singing your own praises?

00:10:48.180 --> 00:10:50.420
It’s the objective truth.

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:56.680
If I help you, your dormant abilities may bloom.

00:10:56.680 --> 00:10:59.060
So what'll you do for me?

00:10:59.060 --> 00:11:00.660
Can you actually do anything?

00:11:00.660 --> 00:11:05.960
I can be a compassionate observer from up close.

00:11:05.960 --> 00:11:08.000
I don’t need that!

00:11:08.320 --> 00:11:10.440
My turn!  I draw!

00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:14.440
I activate the Field Spell, Trickstar Live Stage’s effect!

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:19.620
Once per turn, when there's a set card in the opponent's Spell & Trap Zone...

00:11:19.620 --> 00:11:23.680
...you can Special Summon a Trickstar Token in defense position.

00:11:26.060 --> 00:11:33.360
Divaridis now activates the effect she gained by equipping Birdhelm!

00:11:34.600 --> 00:11:40.480
Every time a Trickstar is Special Summoned to my field, you take 200 damage!

00:11:40.480 --> 00:11:46.480
Now even if we don’t summon, she can summon to deal damage.

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:51.480
And we know her Trickstars’ powers develop.

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:53.460
I won’t let you!

00:11:53.460 --> 00:11:56.420
I'll stop your strategies now!

00:11:57.320 --> 00:12:01.120
I activate the Continuous Trap, Gate of Fire!

00:12:01.940 --> 00:12:06.160
As long as I have this, I don’t take effect damage that are 300 or less!

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:09.820
Divaridis’s damage becomes 0.

00:12:09.820 --> 00:12:12.900
Now Blue Girl’s combo is stopped!

00:12:12.900 --> 00:12:16.240
I activate my Skill!  Trickstar Gig!

00:12:16.240 --> 00:12:22.060
For every Trickstar monster on my field, I send a card from the top of my deck to the graveyard!

00:12:22.060 --> 00:12:24.180
I have three Trickstars!

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:27.180
So I send three cards to the graveyard!

00:12:29.160 --> 00:12:33.420
Then I add a Trickstar in my graveyard to my hand.

00:12:33.420 --> 00:12:36.880
I add this card!

00:12:38.660 --> 00:12:43.380
I’ll show you the strength of my powered-up Trickstar Deck!

00:12:43.380 --> 00:12:46.620
Shine!  The circuit of courage and determination!

00:12:47.340 --> 00:12:50.320
The summoning conditions are two Trickstars!

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:53.540
Link Summon!

00:12:53.540 --> 00:12:58.280
Appear!  Link 2 Trickstar Holly Angel!

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:02.980
Live Stage’s effect activates!

00:13:03.480 --> 00:13:08.820
I Special Summon a Trickstar Token next to my Trickstar Link Monster’s link!

00:13:10.440 --> 00:13:14.020
I’ll use the card I gained with my Skill!

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:16.920
I activate the spell card, Trickstar Fusion!

00:13:16.920 --> 00:13:23.620
I send Fusion Material Monsters from my hand and field to the graveyard to Fusion Summon!

00:13:23.620 --> 00:13:27.580
Hear the song of the Trickstars!

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:29.760
Fusion Summon!

00:13:33.440 --> 00:13:37.080
Trickstar Band Sweet Guitar!

00:13:39.220 --> 00:13:41.720
A Trickstar Fusion Monster?

00:13:41.720 --> 00:13:44.720
That’s not recorded in my data.

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:48.160
It means she's continued to grow.

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:55.680
By Fusion Summoning Sweet Guitar, take Divaridis’s effect!

00:13:58.420 --> 00:13:59.980
That's pointless!

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:03.140
Due to Gate of Fire, 300 or less damage is negated-

00:14:03.140 --> 00:14:08.120
When linked to Sweet Guitar, a Trickstar's effect damage is doubled!

00:14:10.880 --> 00:14:12.340
What?

00:14:12.840 --> 00:14:16.820
Take Divaridis's double damage for 400!

00:14:21.260 --> 00:14:24.980
Since I dealt you effect damage, Sweet Guitar’s effect!

00:14:24.980 --> 00:14:29.520
She gains ATK equal to the Trickstar's effect damage!

00:14:29.520 --> 00:14:34.200
I banish Trickstar Fusion from my graveyard to activate its effect!

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:37.390
I add a Trickstar in my graveyard to my hand.

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:43.400
But the monster I get can’t be summoned or Special Summoned this turn.

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:48.730
I add Trickstar Calobane to my hand!

00:14:48.730 --> 00:14:51.150
I'll end you this turn!

00:14:51.150 --> 00:14:54.970
Battle!  Sweet Guitar attacks Heatleo!

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:57.450
Ambitious Code!

00:14:59.280 --> 00:15:04.810
I send Salamangreat Raccoon from my hand to the graveyard to activate its effect!

00:15:04.810 --> 00:15:09.420
I regain LP equal to the opponent’s ATK!

00:15:10.280 --> 00:15:16.300
And you can’t activate spells, traps or monster effects during this battle!

00:15:16.300 --> 00:15:19.000
That includes Calobane’s effect!

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:24.680
And Heatleo can't be destroyed in battle this turn!

00:15:25.370 --> 00:15:27.870
But you still take damage!

00:15:32.380 --> 00:15:34.970
Divaridis attacks Heatleo!

00:15:34.970 --> 00:15:39.230
And I activate the Trickstar Calobane's effect from my hand!

00:15:39.230 --> 00:15:45.200
By sending this card to the graveyard, Divaridis’s ATK increase to 3600!

00:15:51.530 --> 00:15:54.480
You couldn’t end me this turn.

00:15:55.350 --> 00:15:57.510
I end my turn.

00:15:57.510 --> 00:16:01.330
It’s true I couldn't defeat you this turn.

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:03.460
But I will next turn!

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:09.860
When Sweet Guitar attacks, her ATK return to normal at the end of the turn.

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:13.620
And I can add a Trickstar monster in my graveyard to my hand.

00:16:13.620 --> 00:16:19.640
I was able to use Lycoris to stop his Skill, but that was until he activated Gate of Fire.

00:16:19.640 --> 00:16:22.130
She can’t do that anymore.

00:16:22.130 --> 00:16:26.130
So I'll add Calobane to my hand!

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:29.130
This situation is pretty bad.

00:16:29.400 --> 00:16:31.730
That’s not entirely true.

00:16:31.730 --> 00:16:35.110
Looking from a different angle, Blue Girl failed to win...

00:16:35.110 --> 00:16:37.800
...and you’re the one trying to seize victory.

00:16:37.800 --> 00:16:38.600
What?

00:16:38.600 --> 00:16:43.080
There’s a card in your deck that'll break you out of this situation.

00:16:43.750 --> 00:16:45.530
You mean that card?

00:16:45.530 --> 00:16:48.490
That’s right.  You know which one.

00:16:49.570 --> 00:16:51.970
My turn!  I draw!

00:16:52.850 --> 00:16:54.310
I didn’t draw it.

00:16:54.310 --> 00:16:57.440
The goddess of destiny has forsaken me.

00:16:57.440 --> 00:16:59.770
No need to be depressed.

00:16:59.770 --> 00:17:02.400
Goddesses aren't attracted to you.

00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:04.240
Not the time to mess around!

00:17:04.240 --> 00:17:08.320
Instead of moaning about destiny, draw the card yourself.

00:17:08.320 --> 00:17:12.880
Or do you lack the courage to drop to 100 LP against her combo?

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:13.860
What?

00:17:13.860 --> 00:17:18.460
Will you face destiny or run from it?  This is the turning point.

00:17:18.460 --> 00:17:22.560
If you’re my partner, you should face it with confidence.

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:26.060
Interesting!  If that's what you say, I have to do it!

00:17:30.710 --> 00:17:32.470
No way!

00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:34.870
I activate my Skill!

00:17:36.400 --> 00:17:39.550
Burn your soul, Soulburner!

00:17:39.550 --> 00:17:47.440
I lower my LP to 100, and I draw a card for every 1000 LP I give!

00:17:47.440 --> 00:17:51.590
Burning Draw!

00:17:54.390 --> 00:17:57.740
You drew our card of destiny!

00:17:57.740 --> 00:17:59.170
Here I go!

00:17:59.170 --> 00:18:03.000
I activate the spell card, Fusion of Fire!

00:18:03.780 --> 00:18:08.440
I send Fusion Material Monsters to the graveyard to Fusion Summon!

00:18:08.440 --> 00:18:12.000
Fusion Summon is your secret weapon?

00:18:12.000 --> 00:18:17.040
If you summon a monster, Divaridis and Sweet Guitar’s combo will end you.

00:18:17.040 --> 00:18:18.780
Are you sure?

00:18:20.100 --> 00:18:25.390
My Fusion Material Monsters are Heatleo and one Link Monster!

00:18:25.390 --> 00:18:27.520
Link Monster?

00:18:27.520 --> 00:18:32.130
Other than Heatleo, you have no Link Monsters on your field.

00:18:32.130 --> 00:18:35.820
Exactly.  Not on my field.

00:18:35.820 --> 00:18:41.110
But Fusion of Fire lets me use monsters on both our fields to Fusion Summon!

00:18:41.110 --> 00:18:45.070
I Fusion Summon using the Link Monster, Divaridis!

00:18:45.070 --> 00:18:46.850
No way…

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:48.370
Appear!

00:18:48.370 --> 00:18:51.110
The origin of a crazy soul!

00:18:51.110 --> 00:18:56.590
The magical beast whose flesh gathers the weapons of evil beasts!

00:18:57.320 --> 00:18:58.790
Fusion Summon!

00:18:59.680 --> 00:19:03.960
Salamangreat Violet Chimera!

00:19:09.410 --> 00:19:16.390
Getting Materials, stopping combos, eliminating monsters and summoning his ace.

00:19:16.390 --> 00:19:19.410
He did all this at once?

00:19:19.410 --> 00:19:22.140
Violet Chimera’s effect activates!

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:25.450
When it's Fusion Summoned, until the end of the turn...

00:19:25.450 --> 00:19:30.890
...it gains ATK equal to half the Fusion Material Monsters' ATK!

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:36.860
Battle!  Violet Chimera attacks Sweet Guitar!

00:19:38.450 --> 00:19:41.430
I'll reduce the damage as much as possible!

00:19:41.430 --> 00:19:44.160
I activate Calobane’s effect from my hand!

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:49.510
By sending her to the graveyard, Sweet Guitar’s ATK are doubled!

00:19:50.480 --> 00:19:52.120
I knew you'd do that.

00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:58.950
You examined your own weaknesses, and you chose a card to deal with it.

00:19:58.950 --> 00:20:02.920
That’s why I knew you'd use Calobane!

00:20:02.920 --> 00:20:04.640
What are you trying to say?

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:06.650
That I’m the one who’ll win.

00:20:07.150 --> 00:20:10.140
Violet Chimera’s additional effect activates!

00:20:10.460 --> 00:20:17.330
When it battles a monster whose ATK has changed from its original points, its ATK are doubled!

00:20:17.330 --> 00:20:19.800
9700 ATK?

00:20:19.800 --> 00:20:20.880
Go!

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:23.240
Violet Soul!

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:36.360
No way…  She lost from that position?

00:20:39.820 --> 00:20:44.330
Blue Girl, you’re stronger than before.

00:20:44.330 --> 00:20:49.210
But you didn’t have an excellent AI like me.

00:20:49.210 --> 00:20:53.620
Continue being my compassionate observer.

00:20:54.800 --> 00:20:59.930
You won this duel because of the bond between an AI and a human?

00:21:03.330 --> 00:21:05.030
What did you do to her?

00:21:05.030 --> 00:21:07.440
I had her log out.

00:21:10.930 --> 00:21:15.760
I'd challenge you to a duel, but you're in no condition for that.

00:21:15.760 --> 00:21:19.660
And I lost my partner, so I’ll withdraw for today.

00:21:19.660 --> 00:21:21.620
Then use this.

00:21:22.100 --> 00:21:23.520
What’s this?

00:21:23.520 --> 00:21:28.130
A copy of the escape program I received from Ghost Girl.

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:29.600
Here.

00:21:31.660 --> 00:21:34.840
You might be cuter than Ai.

00:21:37.010 --> 00:21:39.820
I’ll withdraw for today!

00:21:39.820 --> 00:21:41.620
Let’s meet again someday.

00:21:42.710 --> 00:21:44.430
She’s a goddess!

00:21:44.430 --> 00:21:46.760
Don’t be serious!

00:21:51.250 --> 00:21:54.850
There’s the edge of the wind field!

00:21:54.850 --> 00:21:56.800
Yeah.  Seems so.

00:21:58.210 --> 00:22:01.480
That’s where he is.

00:22:19.970 --> 00:22:26.310
Memories that don't disappear
And memories that disappeared

00:22:26.540 --> 00:22:33.010
I quietly "NOW LOADING..." those scenes

00:22:33.440 --> 00:22:36.510
Memories left behind  Erased memories

00:22:36.510 --> 00:22:39.650
What was the PASSWORD again?

00:22:40.080 --> 00:22:44.250
ACCESS records  Restored memories

00:22:44.520 --> 00:22:47.220
Challenge "the you inside you"

00:22:51.930 --> 00:22:58.100
You're a Network  The World that spreads beyond

00:22:58.240 --> 00:23:01.240
With repeating "nows"

00:23:01.570 --> 00:23:05.180
What about you?  "Live for now"

00:23:05.340 --> 00:23:11.130
Grab the Shooting Star in the sky with both your hands

00:23:11.280 --> 00:23:14.420
Overcome "now" with all your might  Yell!

00:23:36.950 --> 00:23:44.870
The peaceful sea of clouds is swirling with Bohman's anger.

00:23:44.870 --> 00:23:49.710
No one can understand the pain he bears.

00:23:49.710 --> 00:23:55.310
His regrets push him to greater heights.

00:23:55.310 --> 00:23:58.330
I will end it with him here!

00:23:58.330 --> 00:24:02.510
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
Final Battle Above the Clouds

00:24:02.510 --> 00:24:04.810
Into the VRAINS!
